*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions in the Windows calculator - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/desktop_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Start Calculator
    [Documentation]    Starts the calculator and waits for its window.
    Launch Program
    Wait For Window    ${calculator}
    Focus Element    ${calculator.result}

Calculate
    [Documentation]    Calculates the expression, e.g. "12+30" or "6*7".
    [Arguments]    ${expression}
    Type Into Window    ${calculator}    ${expression}\=

Close Calculator
    [Documentation]    Closes the calculator.
    Close Program
